<title>CANADA: BC Tel in US$60 mln equipment purchase.</title>
<headline>BC Tel in US$60 mln equipment purchase.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BC Telecom Inc signed a deal to buy US$60 million of digital switching equipment from AG Communications Systems of Phoenix, AG said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>AG said the volume purchase agreement covered its GTD-5 Class 5 central office digital switching equipment and IN products.</p>
<p>((Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314))</p>
</text>
